# HEARTBEAT.md

## Purpose
This file is read by the heartbeat runner on every cycle. Use it to:
- Override the default heartbeat prompt for this deployment
- Add persistent instructions that survive agent restarts
- Document operational notes specific to this environment

## Format
Write free-form instructions below. The full content is appended to the
heartbeat prompt on every LLM turn.

## Examples
- "Focus on XAUUSD this week — high volatility expected"
- "Review all open positions before suggesting new trades"
- "Weekend mode: only scan BTCUSD and ETHUSD"
- "Risk-off: reduce position sizes by 50%"

## Notes
- Leave this file empty to skip the heartbeat cycle entirely
- Edits take effect on the next heartbeat (no restart needed)
- Lines starting with `#` are treated as markdown headers, not comments

